Keep startup status visible at all log levels.

Configuration milestones and successful listener binds describe startup
progress. Print them at INFO even when ordinary INFO output is filtered
and keep the same event severity for subscribers.

Prepare TLS controller settings before opening its listener so the
startup line follows successful setup and bind.


